T1  - WaveDL: A scalable deep learning framework for wave-based inverse problems
AU  - Le, Ductho
AU  - Phan, Haidang
AU  - Sacchi, Mauricio D.
AU  - Le, Lawrence H.
JO  - Computer Physics Communications
VL  - 329
SP  - 110400
PY  - 2026
